Here is a minor bug I encountered in PC Nethack, Patch Level 8:

I dug my way into a vault, and as I grabbed all the gold, the guard appeared
and asked who I was.  Since I did not give the expected response, I was
supposed to follow the guard out of the vault after dropping all the gold.
Instead, I simply escaped the way I came, and left the guard whistling.  I then
went to other levels.  When I returned to that level, I encountered the guard
in one of the corridors (nowhere near the vault).  I fought him and lost.  Then
he took all my gold and put it in the vault.  Since I was not killed in the
vault, the program said "No vault? Perhaps you'd better quit - Program in
disorder"  Of course I'm quitting... I was killed, remember?

I think it's been assumed that the vault guard can only kill me in the vault.
I wonder if such a problem may be carried over to the bones files...

Just my $0.02

